/T (Listen: Bind to port 8888 and accept all incoming TCP connections Detect: Record attacker IP address, port, payload data, and timestamp Trap: Capture login credentials via the fake EduNova portal login form Flag: Auto-flag any visitor to hidden trap URLs \(/admin, /.env, /phpmyadmin etc.\) Respond: Send a fake HTTP 403 Access Denied banner with EduPortal-v2.1 server header Visualize: Display real-time attack statistics, charts and live log table on dashboard)
/E (Listen: Bind to port 8888 and accept all incoming TCP connections Detect: Record attacker IP address, port, payload data, and timestamp Trap: Capture login credentials via the fake EduNova portal login form Flag: Auto-flag any visitor to hidden trap URLs \(/admin, /.env, /phpmyadmin etc.\) Respond: Send a fake HTTP 403 Access Denied banner with EduPortal-v2.1 server header Visualize: Display real-time attack statistics, charts and live log table on dashboard)
