/T (Thes ystem is builtastwo cooperating Python applications running side by side. The core honeypot \(honeypot.py\) is a multi-threaded TCP socket server that binds to port 8888 and listens for connections indefinitely. The dashboard \(dashboard.py\) is a separate Flask web server that serves the fake EduNova portal, captures login attempts, and provides a threat intelligence dashboard. Both applications share state only through the CSV and JSON log files, keeping them fully decoupled.)
/E (Thes ystem is builtastwo cooperating Python applications running side by side. The core honeypot \(honeypot.py\) is a multi-threaded TCP socket server that binds to port 8888 and listens for connections indefinitely. The dashboard \(dashboard.py\) is a separate Flask web server that serves the fake EduNova portal, captures login attempts, and provides a threat intelligence dashboard. Both applications share state only through the CSV and JSON log files, keeping them fully decoupled.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [27]
>>
