/Title (system. The system is designed to listen on a dedicated port, log every connection attempt in real time, send a fake 'Access Denied' banner to the attacker, and present all captured threat data through a web-based monitoring dashboard. It is inspired by the working principle of enterprise honeypot tools such as Cowrie and T-Pot used by real security teams.)
