/Title (The Honeypot Network for EdTech Threat Intelligence is a real-time cybersecurity monitoring system built using Python, the socket library, threading, and Flask. It listens on port 8888, captures every connection attempt with IP and timestamp, logs the data to CSV and JSON files, responds with a fake EduPortal server banner, and presents all threat data through an interactive web-based dashboard.)
